--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

FFmpeg (bundled in the UXP plugin's native addon)
    The UXP plugin ships a statically linked FFmpeg 8.1.2 inside
    uxp/win/x64/unphased.uxpaddon (and the macOS equivalents when built). It is
    configured with --disable-everything plus audio demuxers, decoders and
    parsers only, and WITHOUT --enable-gpl, so it is used under the
    GNU Lesser General Public License version 2.1 or later.

    FFmpeg source: https://ffmpeg.org
    LGPL v2.1: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/lgpl-2.1.html

    The exact configure invocation used to produce the bundled build is recorded
    in uxp/native/README.md. Anyone receiving this software is entitled to the
    FFmpeg source and to the object files needed to relink the addon against a
    modified FFmpeg; open an issue to request them.

IBM Plex Sans / IBM Plex Mono (bundled in both plugins)
    SIL Open Font License 1.1 — see cep/fonts/LICENSE.txt and
    uxp/fonts/LICENSE.txt.

Adobe UXP Addon SDK glue (uxp/native/uxp/src/api, uxp/native/uxp/src/utilities)
    Provided by Adobe as part of the UXP hybrid-addon sample code, used
    unmodified under Adobe's terms for that sample.
